OL,3,GNEWSA'Five minutes from losing my leg -
OL,4,Anow I'm helping others with trauma'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was early on a summer's morning in
OL,7,F2017 when Jake Cooper's life changed
OL,8,Fforever.
OL,10,FHe was a passenger in a car which
OL,11,Fstruck a tree and overturned on Rivelin
OL,12,FValley Road in Sheffield. Just 21 and a
OL,13,Ftrainee electrician at the time, Cooper
OL,14,Fsustained a traumatic brain injury and
OL,15,Fwas left with fractures to his spine, a
OL,16,Fbroken arm, multiple blood clots, a
OL,17,Fbroken left leg and ankle, and an open
OL,18,Ffracture of his right lower leg.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
