OL,3,GNEWSA'Five minutes from losing my leg -
OL,4,Anow I'm helping others with trauma'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs he looks ahead to the 10th
OL,7,Fanniversary of the crash, which the
OL,8,Fdriver also survived, Cooper has
OL,9,Fqualified as a personal trainer and now
OL,10,Fhelps others recover from brain
OL,11,Finjuries.
OL,13,FCooper, now 31, married his long-term
OL,14,Fgirlfriend last year and works for the
OL,15,FNHS, seeing clients around the country
OL,16,Fand helping them to regain their
OL,17,Ffitness.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
